    "description": "Explains DSP math concepts to developers who need the theory behind an algorithm. Use whenever the user asks how a signal-processing concept works, wants intuition behind a formula, or hits a math-shaped bug. Trigger on phrases like \"how does a Fourier transform work\", \"explain z-transforms\", \"what is convolution\", \"why does my biquad ring\", \"what is windowing for\", \"what causes aliasing\", or \"how do I convert gain to dB\". Also trigger when the user pastes DSP code and asks why it behaves a certain way.\n",
